# Signed Euler vortex gas with all vortex centers inside r<=0.5.
# Same 360 vortices, widths, amplitudes and seed as the domain-filling case.
# Gaussian tails are small near the wall; the Poisson field is not compact.
# p=6, 50k+ triangles, semi-implicit Euler dt=0.01 to T=50.
--preset euler_vortex_gas_localized_p6_50k_dt001_t50_raw_cuda_bsr
